ML EC2 > IAM Role: Assume role with limited S3 access
IAM Role > Model S3 Bucket: Read-only (GetObject)
Model S3 Bucket > ML EC2: Pull latest model artifact
Model S3 Bucket > Model Versioning: Maintain historical versions
Model S3 Bucket > KMS Encryption: Encrypted at rest
